.pio/
compile_commands.json
platformio.local.ini
# LittleFS image source: provision.json holds the WiFi password and the
# device API key. Never commit it — it is flashed to the board with
# `pio run -t uploadfs` as a faster alternative to the setup portal.
data/
# Serial captures from read_serial.py. Regenerable machine output, and a long
# unattended run is megabytes of heartbeat lines. What a run PROVED belongs in
# docs/history/ as prose with the numbers quoted — not the raw log.
logs/
